        "component": "RTSP demuxer and muxer",
        "source": "ff_rtsp_connect() in libavformat/rtsp.c follows RTSP 3xx redirects without a limit (goto redirect at rtsp.c:2225 in n9.0.2). The function is under #if CONFIG_RTSP_DEMUXER || CONFIG_RTSP_MUXER, and libavformat/Makefile links rtsp.o only for the RTSP demuxer, the RTSP muxer and the SDP demuxer. None is enabled: configure's enabled demuxers are gif, matroska and mov, the muxers gif, mov, webm, matroska, mp4 and webp, and the only protocol is file.",
        "reason": "Affected code is not built or shipped: RTSP demuxer and muxer (ff_rtsp_connect's redirect loop in libavformat/rtsp.c, compiled only for the RTSP demuxer/muxer and SDP demuxer; the build has --disable-network and only the file protocol). Verified against the pinned source, CI configure output and exact bundled libraries.",
